<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Rend Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 30
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> rend &lt;target&gt;
 rend               (in a fight: your opponent)
</pre>
<p>The Barbarian swings a heavy blade and tears a gaping wound in the enemy. It 
only works with a cleaving weapon in your hand, the same ones as for 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cleave</a>: a lucern hammer, halberd, battle axe, great axe, war axe, 
lochaber axe, bill guisarme, bec de corbin, great sword or claymore.
</p><p>The swing starts the fight if there wasn't one. If your constitution and 
strength win over your enemy's constitution and dexterity, the wound keeps 
bleeding for a while: they lose hit points and endurance with every few 
moments, and they can bleed to death. The better the rend, the longer it 
bleeds. A wound that bleeds already can't be opened again until it stops.
</p><p>Each rend takes 75 endurance, so you need more than that to try. You can rend 
another player only when both of you have signed the book of blood.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Barbarian</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cleave</a>
</pre>




</div>